 true] [17592186278327 1145 "Since our quadratic polynomial has the double root ${y}_{1}={y}_{2}=4,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(y-{y}_{1})^{2} & =3{(y-4)}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{(y-4)}^{2} & =3({y}^{2}-8y+16) \\\\  & =3{y}^{2}-24y+48.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(y)=3{y}^{2}-24y+48.$" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278329 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278330 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278331 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278332 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278333 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1041 "selection" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1104 #edb/ref 17592186278332 13194139534139 true] [17592186278328 1110 #uuid "e9682328-9250-599d-8be2-3c20d60571db" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278329 1034 "3{y}^{2}-3y+96" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278329 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534139 true] [17592186278329 1111 #uuid "802b9584-bb20-55cb-8e74-930d7e4bddc4" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278330 1034 "3{y}^{2}-12y+32" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278330 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534139 true] [17592186278330 1111 #uuid "9e4079ec-58cf-5d5a-9821-718da5c586f2" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278331 1034 "3{y}^{2}-4y+24" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278331 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534139 true] [17592186278331 1111 #uuid "96dc2268-34c8-5561-a2a0-2ce38ba6accf" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278332 1034 "3{y}^{2}-24y+48" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278332 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534139 true] [17592186278332 1111 #uuid "d62d10f9-9481-5ed6-ba3c-c78fd02e0d3e" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278333 1034 "3{y}^{2}-8y+16" 13194139534139 true] [17592186278333 1103 